# Zoomed out (half and quarter scale) the static world is a cached picture and people are drawn
# over it: nobody may be drawn who stands, their whole width, behind something in front of them
# (the owner's "people on the roofs"). Checked person by person against the order's own depth
# rule, worked out from the map's items rather than from the cover map that hides them. Without
# that map 236 of the 440 people about the Forum at half scale, and 381 of 743 at quarter scale
# (1920x1080), are drawn over a building they stand behind. Many are still drawn: the streets
# and the square are full.
set season spring
set day 9
set time 0.0417
set city forum
set city camera
set world forum 0.5
wait 90
expect city coarse 30 400
expect city covered 12 0 0
shot shots/city_forum_half.png
set world forum 0.25
wait 90
expect city coarse 60 800
expect city covered 12 0 0
shot shots/city_forum_quarter.png
# Athens' Agora below the Acropolis' terraces and Parsa's terrace with its stairs: raised ground
# and landmarks in pieces hide who is behind them too.
set city agora
set city camera
set world agora 0.5
wait 90
expect city coarse 20 400
expect city covered 12 0 0
set city terrace
set city camera
set world terrace 0.5
wait 90
expect city coarse 20 400
expect city covered 12 0 0
quit
